  "title": "Show related packet delegate on the first visible column",
  "description": "My attempt at fixing #20469. Unfortunately I'm not familiar with Qt and Wireshark's GUI codebase, but I tested the following cases and it correctly shows the related packet delegate on the first visible column:\n1. Show/hide first column by right clicking and checking/unchecking it\n2. Show/hide first column from Columns properties\n3. Delete first visible column by right clicking\n4. Delete first visible column from Columns properties\n5. Move column to first position",
